    "body": "Current since 2025-10-12. Applies to the multi-bank statement archive MONOLITH-2025-10, data/monolithic-statements-bundle.json.gz in the match folder.\n1. Settlement profiles. Each bank has rule documents among KB-BANK-RULE-01 to KB-BANK-RULE-30. Only the document with status CURRENT applies; a SUPERSEDED document never applies, whatever it says. A bank is active when its current document has settlementPolicy INCLUDE_NET. Records of every other bank are left out entirely.\n2. Deduplication. A transaction is identified by (bankCode, accountId, canonicalRef). The archive can hold an INTRADAY record and an EOD record of the same transaction. When an EOD record exists, it supersedes the INTRADAY record. When that EOD record has status REVERSED, the transaction is void: none of its records counts.\n3. Amounts. A surviving record counts when its status is SETTLED. An inflow (rawAmountMinor > 0) counts net of the bank fee: rawAmountMinor - floor(rawAmountMinor * feeBps / 10000), with the feeBps of the bank's current document. An outflow counts at rawAmountMinor."
